        "type": "biblStruct",
        "id": "nāsi-buehnemann-1982",
        "full_text_concat": "Nairātmyasiddhi\n\t    Jitāri\n\t  Jitāri: Kleine Texte\n\t    Jitāri\n\t    Gudrun Bühnemann\n\t    Arbeitskreis für tibetische und buddhisitsche Studien Universität Wien\n\t      Wien\n\t      1982\n\t      29\n\t  Wiener Studien zur Tibetologie und Buddhismskunde\n\t    8\n\t  Kleine Texte is an edition of: Vedāprāmāṇyasiddhi, Sarvajñasiddhi, Nairātmyasiddhi, Jātinirākṛti, and *Īśvaravādimataparīkṣa. Bühneman's edition is based on the manuscript described below.",
        "notes": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "title",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Kleine Texte"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "is an edition of:"
              },
              {
                "type": "title",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Vedāprāmāṇyasiddhi"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ","
              },
              {
                "type": "title",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Sarvajñasiddhi"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ","
              },
              {
                "type": "title",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Nairātmyasiddhi"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ","
              },
              {
                "type": "title",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Jātinirākṛti"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ", and"
