  "body": [
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "pb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb",
            "n": "29"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "head",
          "text": "Nairātmyasiddhi",
          "segment_number": 1,
          "translated_text": "<s>Nairātmyasiddhi</s> (Establishment of Non-Self)"
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "pb",
          "attributes": {
            "edRef": "nāsi-ms",
            "n": "IB.2.7.5"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "epigraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "namo buddhāya |",
              "segment_number": 2,
              "translated_text": "Homage to the <s>Buddha</s>!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "yasya yena saha kaścit pratibandho nāsti",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "surplus",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "|",
              "segment_number": 4,
              "translated_text": "—"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "na sa tena ta",
              "segment_number": 5,
              "translated_text": "it is not possessed of that"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "break": "no",
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "d",
              "segment_number": 6,
              "translated_text": "."
            },
            {
              "tag": "supplied",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "v",
              "segment_number": 7,
              "translated_text": ""
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "ān | tad yathā himālayo malayena |",
              "segment_number": 8,
              "translated_text": "For example, the <s>Himālaya</s> with the <s>Malaya</s> [mountain]. The living body has no connection whatsoever with a permanent self —"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "na sthirātmanā saha kaścit saṃbandho jīvaccharīrasya",
              "segment_number": 9,
              "translated_text": "this is the non-apprehension of the pervader (<s>vyāpakānupalabdhi</s>)."
            },
            {
              "tag": "supplied",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "i",
              "segment_number": 10,
              "translated_text": ""
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "ti",
              "segment_number": 11,
              "translated_text": ""
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "vyāpakānupalabdhiḥ",
              "segment_number": 12,
              "translated_text": ""
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "nāyam asiddho hetuḥ | yataḥ saṃbandho bhavan tādātmyaṃ tadu",
              "segment_number": 13,
              "translated_text": "This reason is not unestablished (<s>asiddha</s>). For a connection, if it existed, would be either identity (<s>tādātmya</s>) or causal origination (<s>tadutpatti</s>)."
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "break": "no",
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "tpattir vā bhāvet | na ca tādātmyam ātmaśarīrayoḥ | śarīrasyā",
              "segment_number": 14,
              "translated_text": "And there is no identity between the self and the body, because the body is of an impermanent nature"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "break": "no",
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "nityādirūpa",
              "segment_number": 15,
              "translated_text": "and the like,"
            },
            {
              "tag": "pb",
              "attributes": {
                "edRef": "#nāsi-ms",
                "n": "IA.2.7"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "tvāt | tadviparītasyātmano abhyupetatvāt |",
              "segment_number": 16,
              "translated_text": "while the self is accepted as being the opposite of that."
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "nāpi tadutpattir nityasyātmanaḥ śarīra-utpattyayogāt",
              "segment_number": 17,
              "translated_text": "Nor is there causal origination, since a permanent self cannot produce a body,"
            },
            {
              "tag": "note",
              "attributes": {
                "n": "29-1",
                "lang": "de"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "text": "Lies",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "q",
                      "attributes": {
                        "type": "variant",
                        "lang": "sa-Latn"
                      },
                      "text": "śarīrād ut°"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "| ni",
              "segment_number": 18,
              "translated_text": "nor"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "break": "no",
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "tyātmano vā śarīrasya |",
              "segment_number": 19,
              "translated_text": "[can] the body [produce] a permanent self."
            }
          ],
          "segment_number": 3,
          "translated_text": "That which has no connection whatsoever with something"
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "saṃyogalakṣaṇas tayoḥ saṃbandha iti cet |",
          "segment_number": 20,
          "translated_text": "If it be objected that the connection between them has the character of conjunction (<s>saṃyoga</s>) —"
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "tenaiva saha tayoḥ",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "surplus",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "|",
              "segment_number": 22,
              "translated_text": "?"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "kaḥ saṃbandhaḥ |",
              "segment_number": 23,
              "translated_text": ""
            }
          ],
          "segment_number": 21,
          "translated_text": "[we ask:] what connection do those two have with that very [conjunction]"
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "samavāya iti cet |",
          "segment_number": 24,
          "translated_text": "If [the answer is] inherence (<s>samavāya</s>) —"
        },
        {
          "tag": "lb",
          "attributes": {
            "ed": "gb"
          }
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "tenāpi saha teṣāṃ kaḥ saṃbandhaḥ",
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "supplied",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "|",
              "segment_number": 26,
              "translated_text": "?"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "saṃbandhāntaropagame",
              "segment_number": 27,
              "translated_text": "If another connection is accepted,"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "anavasthā | anabhyupagame na teṣāṃ samavāyaḥ | tathā cātma",
              "segment_number": 28,
              "translated_text": "there is an infinite regress. If not accepted, there is no inherence for them. Likewise, even if another type of connection between the self"
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "break": "no",
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "śarīrayoḥ saṃbandhāntaraparikalpane 'py a",
              "segment_number": 29,
              "translated_text": "and the body is imagined,"
            },
            {
              "tag": "supplied",
              "attributes": {
                "resp": "#nāsi-bue"
              },
              "text": "ya",
              "segment_number": 30,
              "translated_text": "this"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "m eva dṛṣṭānta",
              "segment_number": 31,
              "translated_text": "very same [objection serves as] the counter-example."
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "iti nāsya hetor asiddhiḥ |",
              "segment_number": 32,
              "translated_text": "Therefore, the reason is not unestablished."
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
              "attributes": {
                "ed": "gb"
              }
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "text": "viruddhatāpy asya nāsti | sapakṣe bhāvāt |",
              "segment_number": 33,
              "translated_text": "Nor is it contradicted (<s>viruddha</s>), because it is present in the similar case (<s>sapakṣa</s>)."
            },
            {
              "tag": "lb",
